{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What is it?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Way of Knight</i> is a <strong>chess</strong>-like puzzle game about the journey of <strong>Esroh the knight</strong>. You pilot the <strong>heroes</strong> through various <strong>enemies</strong>, <strong>boards</strong>, <strong>hazards</strong>, and <strong>stories</strong>. Think your way through different challenges such as defeating all enemies, obtaining special items, and getting to the exit safely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 Story Chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">70+ Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enviromental hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand drawn artstyle</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Meet The Heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517300/extras/meet_the_heroes.png?t=1742468444\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Esroh, Ynop, and ???</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>New Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517300/extras/new_pieces_promo.png?t=1742468444\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All the classic chess pieces and more!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3517300?t=1742468444","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517300/4fdb0f293013021b04678e679ae741da293bf9df/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742468444","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517300/1fff011045269ddc8ce53968f8abe9fab504c8b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742468444","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517300/1fff011045269ddc8